  "title": "Stuffed Flank Steak",
  "description": "Tender stuffed steak with layers of prepared stuffing, green onions, and red bell pepper served with a mushroom and red wine sauce. Easy and elegant!",
  "authors": [
    "BarbiAnn"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-10-26T17:41:58-04:00",
